id: snack-fiend
name: Snack Fiend
prerequisites: N/A
description: >
  You always have a snack on you, hidden away. No one, sometimes not even you, knows it’s there before you need it.
text: >
  Snack Fiend: You always have a snack on you, hidden away. No one, sometimes not even you, knows it’s there before you need it.
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  (1)-[Triggered/Start of Combat Encounter]: If you are not a Minion, gain a Snack Basic Item.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: After using the Snack Basic Item, enter the Superior State until the end of your turn.

---

# (1) The Combat Encounter beginning: chosen on its card (Apply effects) - a Snack on the Gear tab.
[triggered/start-of-encounter, chosen, effect 1]
requires !isMinion;
gainGear(snack);

# (2) A Snack eaten: asked then and there, once an Encounter - Superior till the end of your turn (the Gear tab's consume).
[passive]
allow snackFiend.superior;
